3d1a0ef9d2d04", "user_turn_count": 4, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 533], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "066054688ac890b00e265e5898a608a62e64967b50bfe462cec53f7494a0dbea", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 335], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "7aef07f1f7ffa30e90ad5f466fc874348611c75b54cb81348fcb9ea6f41b5385", "role": "user", "sequence": 4}, {"character_range": [0, 986], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "cbfa2e4fd14f4915a00577bb26f52a782a86d8fc77862a6463e4ff913d28aeb7", "role": "user", "sequence": 8}, {"character_range": [0, 11], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "c368bfe5f914562042c1da5c0bc4a58cdfd506d727eb5e0f5783eee551fb3073", "role": "user", "sequence": 11}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/错题知识网络/可视化错题详情/高等数学/GS-628\\_102423.md&#x20;\n\n这道题我的想法是：\n\n直线 $L\\_0$ 两个方程所对应的法向量：\n\n1. $2x - z - 3 = 0$，法向量是 $(2, 0, -1)$\n2. $y - 2z + 4 = 0$，法向量是 $(0, 1, -2)$\n\n通过 $3 \\times 3$ 的行列式求方向向量，第一行是 $\\mathbf{i}, \\mathbf{j}, \\mathbf{k}$，第二行是 $(2, 0, -1)$，第三行是 $(0, 1, -2)$。按照第一列展开得到 $\\mathbf{i} + 4\\mathbf{j} + 2\\mathbf{k}$，算出它的方向向量是 $(1, 4, 2)$。\n\n另外，平面的方程是 $x + y - z = 5$，看 $x, y, z$ 前面的系数，平面的法向量是 $(1, 1, -1)$。\n\n我算出这两个向量之后，最后的直线 $L$ 因为是投影下来的，所以和投影平面平行。\n\n那这个时候是根据它俩平行得出什么结论来推导最后 $L$ 的表达式呢？还是我的方法一开始就有问题？\n"}